              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon, shield and light armour. May have heavy armour (+1 pt) and upgrade to large shield (+1 pt). May have double-handed sword instead of hand weapon and shield for no extra cost. May have thrusting spear (+1 pt) or spear tipped halberd (+2 pts). Drilled. Stubborn. 0-1. (The Art of War p.43)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
