              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a crossbow and improvised weapon. May have light armour (+2 pts). Volley Firing. Light Infantry. May also be in Combined Formation with Spearmen or Halberdiers. (The Art of War p.43)</characteristic>
