              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a dagger axe. May have sword and shield instead of dagger axe. May have light armour (+2 pts). Levies. Warring States forces made use of massed levies to bulk up their armies; enemy prisoners of war and defectors were often incorporated into armies as wholesale units and are considered the same as Massed Levy. (The Art of War p.43)</characteristic>
