              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon. No options. Eastern Shaman - the Shaman causes fear. 0-1. Army of Chu (if a Military Strategist is not taken), Army of Qi and Army of Yan (may not take a Military Strategist) only. (The Art of War p.46)</characteristic>
