              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon and bow. May have throwing spear (+1 pt) and shield (+2 pts). Allies. Light Cavalry. Steppe Nomad Cavalry. 0-1. Armies of Zhao, Qin and Wei only. (The Art of War p.46)</characteristic>
